     "why": "«Aayiz» = I want, «shariiha» = SIM card, «gdiida» = new.",
     "lesson": "In a phone shop the first guess is 'phone', but a phone is mobaayil or telifoon; shariiha literally means a 'slice', the thin chip you slide in."
