     "answer": 1,
     "why": "«Iiwa» is yes, «bas» here means 'but', and «bidoon basal» is 'without onion'.",
     "lesson": "«Bas» often means 'only', which pulls learners towards 'only onion'; before «bidoon» it works as 'but'."
