     "answer": 1,
     "why": "«Ampliar» means to extend or widen, so the leave grows to 20 weeks.",
     "lesson": "A number in a headline often makes learners guess 'a limit' or 'a cut'; look for the verb: ampliar is related to 'ample', bigger."
