     "answer": 2,
     "why": "«Saa'at chande?»: saa'at = hour, chande = how much is.",
     "lesson": "Chand (how much) appears in all of them; «Chand mishe?» asks a price and «Chand saalete?» asks your age, so you need saa'at to make it about time."
