    "text": "Hamsaaye umad khar-e Mollaa ro gharz begire. Mollaa goft: «Khar khune nist.» Yehu khar ar'ar kard. Hamsaaye goft: «Pas in sedaa-ye chiye?» Mollaa goft: «Harf-e khar-o baavar mikoni, harf-e man-o na?»",
